1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,390
-Guys, guess what? -What?
-大伙們，你們猜怎麼了？ -什麼？

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:07,530
We're having a Halloween party!
我們要辦萬聖節派對

3
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:08,900
-Good! -Great!
-很好 -太棒了

4
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:13,270
-You have to wear a costume. -I can't make it.
-你們得變裝 -我沒辦法參加

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,240
Come on, it'll be fun.
少來了，一定會很好玩的

6
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:20,440
I'll be there. I have to wear a costume to my classes that day anyway.
我會去的 反正那天上課時我也要變裝

7
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:24,170
Tell me you're not gonna dress like a dinosaur.
告訴我 你不會打扮成恐龍

8
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,290
Not two years in a row.
我不會連續兩年那麼做

9
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:31,690
-I'll come, but I'm not dressing up. -You have to.
-我會去的，但我不會變裝 -你得變裝才行

10
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:37,630
No. Halloween is stupid. Dressing up, pretending to be someone you're not.
不，萬聖節太愚蠢了 變裝，假裝你是另一個人

11
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,630
You're an actor.
你是個演員

12
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,330
Ross, are you gonna bring Mona?
羅斯，你會帶蒙娜來嗎？

13
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,940
-I will. -The girl from the wedding?
-我會的 -你在婚禮上認識的那個女孩？

14
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:51,510
If she needs costume ideas, she could be a bikini model..
如果她需要變裝點子 她可以扮成比基尼模特兒…

15
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:55,270
or a slutty nurse, or a sexy cheerleader.
或風流護士 或性感啦啦隊長

16
00:00:55,520 --> 00:01:01,510
Or Leatherface from Texas Chainsaw Massacre. No! Slutty Leatherface.
或是德州電鋸殺人狂裡的皮臉 不，還是風流皮臉好了

17
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,920
Wasn't Joey hitting on her too?
喬伊不也很喜歡她嗎？

18
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:09,030
That's right, he was hitting on her.
沒錯，他喜歡她

19
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:14,000
And I got her. I guess the better man won.
我把到她了 我猜最好的男人才能贏

20
00:01:14,270 --> 00:01:17,330
Please don't take her from me.
