23
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,940
Wait. It's me, Phoebe.
等一下，是我，菲比

24
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:06,590
I thought there was a mirror there. Okay. Bye.
我還以為那裡有鏡子 好吧，再見

25
00:02:06,790 --> 00:02:07,980
Wait a second!
等一下

26
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:10,250
So, what's new with you?
你還好嗎？

27
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:14,220
Nothing. I'm getting married next week.
我很好 下星期我就要結婚了

28
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,950
