婚禮很簡單 我們只邀請家人觀禮

30
00:02:19,630 --> 00:02:20,900
His.
他的家人

31
00:02:22,670 --> 00:02:24,100
Okay.
好吧

32
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:25,900
I'm happy for you.
我為你感到高興

33
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:31,070
Wait. If you want to come, I guess that'd be okay.
等一下，如果你也想來的話 我猜應該沒關係

34
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:32,440
-Really? -Sure.
-真的嗎？ -當然

35
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,310
You could be my sister for the day.
你可以當我的妹妹一天

36
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:38,680
Yeah, okay.
好吧

37
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:43,690
My friends are having a party tonight, so you could come.
我朋友今晚要辦派對 你可以來參加

38
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:46,150
Maybe I could meet the guy.
或許我可以看看他

39
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:49,330
Well, I'm supposed to work tonight.
我今晚要上班

40
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:53,290
I'm supposed to be working now, so who cares!
我現在應該去上班 誰在乎呢？

41
00:02:53,570 --> 00:02:57,660
-It's a costume party. -So that's why you're..
-那是化裝派對 -所以你才會…

42
00:02:58,570 --> 00:02:59,940
No.
不

43
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:02,440
But thanks.
但謝謝

44
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:11,650
-You're supposed to wear a costume. -I am.
-你應該變裝的 -我有啊

45
00:03:11,890 --> 00:03:16,380
I am a woman who spent money on a dress she wants to wear..
我扮成花錢 買心愛洋裝的女人…

46
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:20,190
because soon she won't fit into it.
因為很快地 她會穿不下它

47
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:24,800
I'm Catwoman, who wants the dress when you're too big for it.
我是貓女 如果你穿不下它，可以把它送給我

48
00:03:26,030 --> 00:03:28,730
-Trick or treat! -Can I give out candy?
-不給糖就搗蛋 -我可以分糖果給他們嗎？

49
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:33,910
I want to be with kids. Since I got pregnant, I have maternal instincts.
我想跟孩子們打成一片 我懷孕後母性的直覺都跑出來了

50
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:37,040
-Trick or treat! -Just a minute!
-不給糖就搗蛋 -等一下

51
00:03:42,980 --> 00:03:44,850
Look at you guys!
看看你們

52
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:49,610
-Wow! You are a very scary witch. -Thank you.
-哇，你是個可怕的巫婆 -謝謝

53
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:53,730
-And you are a very funny clown. -Thank you.
-你是個好笑的小丑 -謝謝

54
00:03:53,930 --> 00:03:55,330
And you..
你…

55
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:59,060
are so in style right now.
非常符合現在的流行趨勢

56
00:03:59,330 --> 00:04:04,640
I work at Ralph Lauren. The fall line has got this equestrian theme.
我在羅夫羅蘭的公司工作 今年秋天流行馬術主題

57
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:09,780
-Did you see the cover of Vogue..? -Could I just have the candy?
-你看過時尚雜誌的封面… -我可以拿糖果嗎？

58
00:04:12,410 --> 00:04:14,180
Sure.
沒問題

59
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:25,260
Catwoman. So we meet again.
貓女，我們又見面了

60
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:27,430
So we do, Supergirl.
沒錯，女超人

61
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:30,660
It's me, Phoebe.
我是菲比

62
00:04:32,570 --> 00:04:35,660
Monica, can I talk to you for a second?
摩妮卡 我能跟你談一談嗎？

63
00:04:41,410 --> 00:04:43,430
I appreciate the costume.
謝謝你幫我找衣服

64
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:45,910
You did this to him?
你幫他找衣服？

65
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:47,770
I thought he'd love it.
我覺得他一定會喜歡

66
00:04:48,050 --> 00:04:54,220
-He loves The Velveteen Rabbit. -That rabbit was brown and white.
-他喜歡毛毛兔 -那隻兔子是棕白相間

67
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,720
