他們只剩下粉紅色的兔子裝

68
00:04:56,960 --> 00:05:00,890
No bunny at all. Always no bunny at all!
沒有兔子裝 他們總是說沒有兔子裝

69
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:08,200
-You didn't dress up either? -Yes, I did. I'm Chandler.
-你也沒有變裝？ -不，我有，我扮成錢德

70
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,910
Dude, what happened?
兄弟，發生了什麼事？

71
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,800
How is that me?
我怎麼會是那個樣子？

72
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,340
I'm Chandler.
我是錢德

73
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:24,080
That is so you!
那真的很像你

74
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:28,810
-When have I ever done that? -When have I ever done that?
-我什麼時候會那樣？ -我什麼時候會那樣？

75
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:34,450
Trick or treat.
不給糖就搗蛋

76
00:05:38,670 --> 00:05:42,600
-You're the prettiest ballerina ever. -Thank you.
-你是最漂亮的芭蕾舞孃 -謝謝

77
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:46,440
That deserves another candy.
我該再給你一顆糖果

78
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,630
Thank you.
謝謝

79
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:54,470
I have to say, that earns "two-two" pieces of candy.
我得說 我該再給你一些糖果

80
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:57,280
I love you!
我愛你

81
00:05:59,350 --> 00:06:01,790
Honey, here, take it all.
甜心，通通拿去吧

82
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,790
Monica? We need more candy.
摩妮卡，糖果沒了

83
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:11,620
-There's only been four kids. -I know.
-剛剛只來了四個孩子 -我知道

84
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:15,560
But one said she loved me, so I gave her everything.
但有個孩子說她愛我 於是我全部都給她了

85
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,700
No wonder you're pregnant.
難怪你會懷孕

86
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:30,010
-What are you supposed to be? -Remember the satellite, Sputnik?
-你這次扮成什麼了？ -還記得史波尼克號衛星嗎？

87
00:06:30,820 --> 00:06:35,020
Well, I'm a potato. Or a "spud"..
我扮成馬鈴薯或是「波特多」…

88
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:38,290
and these are my antenna.
這是我的天線

89
00:06:38,490 --> 00:06:41,590
So Sputnik becomes..?
所以史波尼克變成了…

90
00:06:45,570 --> 00:06:49,530
Spud-nik!
波特多尼克

91
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:54,530
Wow! I don't have the worst costume anymore.
哇 原來我不是變裝最失敗的人

92
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:59,340
All right! Ross came as doodie.
好吧，羅斯是團糞

93
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:04,710
-No, I'm not doodie. -No, space-doodie.
-不，我不是糞 -對，你是太空之糞

94
00:07:06,450 --> 00:07:08,390
Okay, I'm Spud-nik.
好吧，我是波特多尼克

95
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:13,890
-You know, like Sputnik. -What's a Sputnik, doodie-man?
-我在模仿史波尼克 -什麼是史波尼克？傻瓜

96
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:22,860
Hey, sweetie.
嘿，甜心

97
00:07:25,610 --> 00:07:27,870
-Aren't you gonna kiss me? -Okay.
-你不吻我嗎？ -好吧

98
00:07:28,110 --> 00:07:31,600
But right after, you have to tell me who you are.
但我吻了你之後 你得告訴我你是誰

99
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,010
-Ursula? -Ursula's fiance?
-烏蘇拉？ -烏蘇拉的未婚夫？

100
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:39,550
You're the sister. I just slapped my future sister-in-law's ass.
你是她的妹妹 我剛剛打了我未來小姨子的屁股

101
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:43,190
Is your mother here? I could slap her on the butt.
你媽媽在這裡嗎？ 我可以打她的屁股

102
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:47,420
-My mother killed herself. -See, and I knew that.
-我媽自殺死掉了 -看吧，我就知道

103
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,430
Now I'm sweating.
我滿身大汗

104
00:07:51,700 --> 00:07:56,760
I'm sweating. Now I'm saying look at me, I'm even sweatier. I should go.
我在流汗，看看我 我滿身大汗，我該走了

105
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,700
No. We'll start over.
不，我們從頭來過

106
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:01,770
-Hi, I'm Phoebe. -Eric.
-嗨，我是菲比 -我是艾力克

107
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:06,640
-Why are you looking at me like that? -Sweat's burning my eyes.
-你為什麼要那樣子看我？ -汗滴到我眼睛裡了

108
00:08:06,910 --> 00:08:08,280
-Thank you. -There.
-謝謝 -拿去吧

109
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:11,210
-What are you? -There's no name for it.
-那是什麼？ -我不知道該怎麼說

110
00:08:11,390 --> 00:08:14,550
I get nervous, and I sweat like crazy.
我一緊張就會滿身大汗

111
00:08:15,890 --> 00:08:20,550
-No, I meant your costume. -I'm a solar system.
-不，我是指你的服裝 -我扮成太陽系

112
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,920
My second graders helped.
我的二年級學生幫我變裝

113
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:26,070
-I love the second grade. -Really?
-我喜歡二年級 -真的嗎？

114
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:32,070
It's much better than first grade, and definitely better than third.
它比一年級好多了 也比三年級好

115
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:35,800
With all the politics and the mind games.
你可以玩爾虞我詐 的鬥智遊戲

116
00:08:36,540 --> 00:08:41,240
-So, what do you do? -I'm a masseuse, by day.
-你是做哪一行的？ -我白天時是按摩師

117
00:08:42,550 --> 00:08:45,850
-You don't have to stand with me. -I'm having fun.
-你不必陪我 -我覺得很開心

118
00:08:46,050 --> 00:08:51,290
-I'm excited for you and Ursula. -I feel very lucky. She's great.
-我為你跟烏蘇拉感到高興 -我覺得自己很幸運，她太棒了

119
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:56,260
-She's the most beautiful woman ever. -Thank you.
-她是最美麗的女人 -謝謝你

120
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:03,790
-Hey, Joey? -Yeah?
-喬伊 -什麼事？

121
00:09:04,070 --> 00:09:07,940
-You read comic books, right? -Exclusively.
-你看漫畫書吧？ -我是專家

122
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:11,670
Who would win in a fight, Catwoman or Supergirl?
如果貓女跟女超人打架 誰會贏呢？

123
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:14,110
-Catwoman, hands down. -Yeah.
-當然是貓女 -太棒了

124
00:09:14,350 --> 00:09:17,720
Between you and Phoebe? I'd give Phoebe the edge.
但你跟菲比嗎？ 我賭菲比會贏

125
00:09:17,890 --> 00:09:19,720
-What? Really? -You kidding?
-什麼？真的嗎？ -你在開玩笑嗎？

126
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:25,480
Phoebe lived on the street, okay? Plus, she's got a crazy temper.
菲比在街上混過，好嗎？ 而且她生起氣來跟瘋婆子一樣

127
00:09:25,730 --> 00:09:28,390
She's not right behind me, is she?
她沒有站在我後面吧？

128
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:30,290
No, you're fine.
不，你很安全

129
00:09:30,530 --> 00:09:33,400
-Could I take Rachel? -I'm not sure.
-我能打倒瑞秋嗎？ -我不確定

130
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:36,140
What? Come on, I am tough!
什麼？少來了，我很凶的

131
00:09:36,370 --> 00:09:39,100
Punch me here, as hard as you can!
用力打我這裡

132
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:42,740
Relax. Why are you so serious? It doesn't matter.
別激動，你為什麼那麼認真？ 那不重要

133
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:47,850
Really? What if I told you Ross or Chandler could beat you up?
真的嗎？如果我告訴你 羅斯或錢德能打倒你呢？

134
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,210
I would say, "Woman, please."
我會說「拜託，女人家」

135
00:09:53,050 --> 00:09:55,550
Ursula's fiance is really sweet.
烏蘇拉的未婚夫真的很帥

136
00:09:56,260 --> 00:09:59,450
-You think you could take him? -The dude with the balls on his chest?
-你覺得你能打倒他嗎？ -胸口貼著球的那個傢伙？

137
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:01,120
I think so.
我想可以

138
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:03,990
But what is he doing with my sister? He's so great.
但他跟我姐姐在一起做什麼？ 他真的太棒了

139
00:10:04,170 --> 00:10:06,760
He's a teacher, he does volunteer work.
他是老師 他會做義工

140
00:10:07,030 --> 00:10:13,670
Normally, I don't like sweaty guys. But I could just mop him up.
通常我不喜歡會流汗的男人 但我願意幫他擦汗

141
00:10:13,910 --> 00:10:16,040
-Oh, my God, Phoebe? -What?
-天啊，菲比 -什麼？

142
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:21,340
-You're getting a crush on him. -No, I'm not, you are!
-你在暗戀他 -不，我才沒有，是你

143
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:24,480
Here comes the temper.
她的脾氣來了

144
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:28,280
Trick or treat.
不給糖就搗蛋

145
