Know what? We're out of candy. But someone went for more.
你知道嗎？我們沒有糖果了 但已經有人去買了

146
00:10:33,290 --> 00:10:38,250
And I've been giving out money, but I'm out of that too.
我改給孩子們錢 但我的錢也都給光了

147
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:40,860
-Can I write you a check? -Okay.
-我可以開張支票給你嗎？ -好吧

148
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:45,940
-Okay. What's your name? -Lelani Mayolanofavich.
-好吧，你叫什麼名字？ -李蘭妮馬尤拉諾法維奇

149
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:51,780
Okay, I'm just gonna write this out to "cash."
好吧，我會寫上 「現金支票」

150
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:55,110
-Hi. -Hi, Mona.
-嗨 -嗨，蒙娜

151
00:10:57,520 --> 00:11:02,220
Joey's gonna be thrilled. He was hoping you'd be a slutty nurse.
喬伊一定會很興奮 他希望你扮成風流護士

152
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:05,550
Actually, I'm just a nurse.
事實上我只是扮成護士

153
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:10,950
You'd think that would embarrass me, but I'm maxed out.
你以為我聽了會覺得很丟臉 但我已經丟夠臉了

154
00:11:12,470 --> 00:11:14,020
-You made it. -Wait.
-你來了 -等一下

155
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:18,570
-You're a potato? -Well, I'm a spud..?
-你是馬鈴薯？ -喔，我是波特多…

156
00:11:18,810 --> 00:11:23,110
-And the antenna.. You're Spud-nik! -Yes!
-還有天線…你是波特多尼克 -答對了

157
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,170
Marry her.
娶她吧

158
00:11:27,650 --> 00:11:31,950
Here's a good one. Who'd win a fight between Ross and Chandler?
這真的很有趣 羅斯跟錢德打架誰會贏？

159
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:34,610
I can't answer that. Chandler's my husband.
我沒辦法回答 錢德是我的老公

160
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:37,260
-So Ross? -Yeah.
-羅斯會贏？ -對

161
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:40,820
-Hey, beautiful. -Hello, handsome.
-嘿，美女 -哈囉，帥哥

162
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,320
Oh, God.
天啊

163
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:47,460
Look at you two. When did you guys meet?
看看你們兩個 你們什麼時候認識的？

164
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:50,070
-Two weeks ago. -That's it?
-兩個星期前 -就那樣？

165
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:54,040
I know. It sounds crazy, and I'm not impulsive, but..
我知道這聽起來很瘋狂 我不是個衝動的人，但是…

166
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:58,340
-we have so much in common. -Oh, really?
-我們有很多共通點 -真的嗎？

167
00:11:58,580 --> 00:12:00,880
We're both teachers.
我們都是老師

168
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:07,150
-And we were both in the Peace Corps. -Peace Corps, really?
-我們都參加了和平工作團 -真的嗎？

169
00:12:08,690 --> 00:12:14,860
When we were building in Uruguay, we were two towns apart and never met.
我們在烏拉圭做義工時 只距離兩個小鎮遠，卻從來沒見過面

170
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:20,260
Yeah. It wasn't a town when I got there, but it was a town when I left.
對，我剛到時那裡一片荒蕪 但我離開時那裡已經是個小鎮了

171
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:24,300
-Shall we get me really drunk? -Sure.
-我們可以去喝一杯嗎？ -沒問題

172
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:32,170
Howdy, doodie.
你好，糞團

173
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,310
That's funny, yeah.
那真的很有趣

174
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:39,320
You're the funniest man here in a bunny costume his wife made him wear.
你是個最幽默的傢伙 穿著你太太幫你挑的兔子裝

175
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:43,990
Relax, man. You're looking a little flushed.
別激動 你看起來有點要化掉了

176
00:12:49,130 --> 00:12:52,590
-Our question might get answered. -What question?
-我們的問題有解了 -什麼問題？

177
00:12:52,830 --> 00:12:56,330
Who could kick whose ass in a fight, you or Ross?
你跟羅斯打架 誰會贏？

178
00:12:57,070 --> 00:13:00,510
-There's no question. -So you think Ross too?
-那不是問題 -你也覺得羅斯會贏？

179
00:13:03,310 --> 00:13:05,780
-You picked Ross? -Ross is strong.
-你選羅斯？ -羅斯很強壯

180
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:10,750
He's the strongest out of all three of you. Except for Joey.
他是你們三個之中最壯的 喬伊除外

181
00:13:11,450 --> 00:13:15,980
-I can't believe you didn't pick me. -She's right. I am stronger.
-我不敢相信你沒有選我 -她說的對，我比你壯

182
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:18,490
I would destroy you.
我要毀了你

183
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:23,460
Really? You think you're stronger? Why don't you prove it?
真的嗎？你覺得你比較壯嗎？ 你為什麼不證明給大家看？

184
00:13:24,430 --> 00:13:27,090
I'll prove it like a theorem!
我一定會證明的

185
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,460
All right! Stop it!
好了，別吵了

186
00:13:30,540 --> 00:13:32,840
Stop! No one's gonna fight.
別吵了，誰都不准打架

187
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:36,640
People came to see a fight, let's give them one!
大家來這裡看人打架 快打給他們看吧

188
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:43,050
-You guys could arm-wrestle. -Listen to the slutty nurse.
-你們可以比腕力 -聽風流護士的話

189
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:48,180
-You're going down. -Oh, yeah? You're going downtown!
-你死定了 -是嗎？你才死定了

190
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:52,450
Seriously, guys, the trash talk is embarrassing.
說真的 你們的叫陣台詞太遜了

191
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:57,790
Gunther, you brought candy. Thank you so much.
阿甘，你買到糖果了 謝謝你

192
00:13:57,970 --> 00:14:00,870
-You are so sweet. -Really?
-你真的是太棒了 -真的嗎？

193
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:05,900
You are gonna make some man the luckiest guy in the world.
跟你在一起的人 會是全世界最幸運的男朋友

194
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:09,040
-Got to go. -Trick or treat.
-我得走了 -不給糖就搗蛋

195
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:13,040
Hi! Wow! There you go.
嗨，拿去吧

196
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:18,010
My friend Lewis told me you were giving out money.
我朋友路易斯說 你會給錢

197
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:21,190
We were, but now we've got candy.
沒錯，但現在我們有糖果了

198
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:24,480
I'd rather have the money.
我寧願要錢

199
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:28,520
That's not your choice. Happy Halloween!
那由不得你來選 萬聖節快樂

200
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:30,090
This isn't fair.
這不公平

201
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:33,660
Is it fair that you put on a cape and get stuff?
你披上斗篷就能跟別人要東西 那公平嗎？

202
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:35,930
Shut up!
閉嘴

203
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,600
You shut up!
你才閉嘴

204
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:43,670
-You can't tell me to shut up. -I think I just did.
-你不能叫我閉嘴 -我想我剛剛說了

205
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:46,310
And here it comes again. Shut up!
我又想說了，閉嘴

206
00:14:48,050 --> 00:14:50,740
No, I got it. I'm good. I got it.
不，我可以，我很厲害的

207
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:55,820
Wait, I had one more thing to say. Right. Shut up.
等一下，我還有一句話要告訴你 對，閉嘴

208
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:58,620
You're a mean old woman.
你是個可怕的老女人

209
00:14:58,890 --> 00:15:00,690
Wait! Shut.. Don't cry!
等一下，閉…別哭了

210
00:15:00,930 --> 00:15:02,920
Let me get my checkbook!
我去拿支票簿

211
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:08,260
You don't have to do this. The strength inside you means the most.
你不必這麼做 心地善良才是最重要的

212
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:12,840
You're loyal, you're honest and you have integrity.
你既忠心又老實 而且你的品德高貴

213
00:15:13,070 --> 00:15:15,840
That's the strength I want in a man.
那才是我要的男人

214
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:19,270
That means nothing to me. Come on!
那對我來說毫無意義，來吧

215
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,040
-Hi, liar. -Hey.
-嗨，騙子 -嘿

216
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:29,720
He's marrying you because he thinks the things you were saying were true.
他會娶你是因為 他以為你說的話是真的

217
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:32,480
-They could be true. -But they're not.
-它們有可能是真的 -但你真的在說謊

218
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:35,060
It's a fine line.
真假只有一線之隔

219
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,760
-Why are you lying? -I don't know.
-你為什麼要說謊？ -我不知道

220
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:44,370
He did this stuff, I said I did it too. He got so excited, it was fun.
他做了那些事，我說我也是 他變得很興奮，我覺得很好玩

221
00:15:44,870 --> 00:15:47,640
You can't do this. You're gonna ruin his life.
你不能那麼做 你會毀了他的生活

222
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:51,570
Why are you taking this so seriously? It's just a marriage.
你為什麼那麼認真？ 這只是婚姻而已

223
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:56,140
Besides, if I cheat on him, I can call it an affair.
而且如果我背著他偷人 我可以說那是外遇

224
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:57,410
Honey?
甜心

225
00:15:57,850 --> 00:16:02,480
It's a disgusting habit, and I want you to quit now!
這是個壞習慣 我要你馬上戒煙

226
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,260
She's helped so many people quit.
她幫助很多人戒煙

227
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:07,820
We'd better get going.
我們得走了

228
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:10,930
-You have a church group meeting. -Right.
-你還得參加教會的聚會 -對

229
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:18,890
-It was nice meeting you. -You too.
-很高興能見到你 -我也是

230
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:23,080
And, Ursula, it was really nice meeting you tonight!
烏蘇拉 我很高興今晚能見到你

231
00:16:23,380 --> 00:16:27,440
Come on! Bunny versus doodie. We're waiting!
快來吧，兔子大戰糞團 我們在等你

232
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:32,720
Okay, guys. One match, winner take all.
好吧，一次決勝負 贏的人是英雄

233
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:36,220
Wait. What does the winner get?
等一下，冠軍有什麼獎品？

234
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:38,410
-Pride. -And dignity.
-驕傲 -跟自尊

235
00:16:38,690 --> 00:16:41,250
Okay, if you say so.
好吧，你說了算

236
00:16:41,530 --> 00:16:43,520
All right, ready, set, go!
好吧，就位，預備，開始

237
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:46,230
-Come on! -Come on!
-加油 -加油

238
00:16:53,410 --> 00:16:58,940
-Wow, they're both really strong. -Or equally weak.
-他們都很壯 -或是一樣遜

239
00:16:59,450 --> 00:17:02,940
Oh, God. Chandler's making his sex face.
天啊 錢德露出他的性感表情了

240
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:13,820
-So you getting tired? -No. I could do this all day.
-你累了嗎？ -不，我可以撐一整天

241
00:17:14,090 --> 00:17:16,460
Yeah. Me too.
對，我也是

242
00:17:18,630 --> 00:17:22,570
-Getting a little tired, though. -God, I'm exhausted.
-但我有點累了 -天啊，我累壞了

243
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:27,970
This is starting to look bad for me, okay? Mona's standing right there.
我開始漏氣了，好嗎？ 蒙娜就站在那裡

244
00:17:29,140 --> 00:17:33,240
She's talking to Joey! You gotta let me win!
她在跟喬伊說話 你得讓我贏

245
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:36,240
Let me win. My wife thinks I'm a wimp.
讓我贏 我太太以為我是三腳貓

246
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:42,120
At least you have a wife. I get divorces and knock people up.
至少你還有太太 我離婚了，還搞大別人的勝子

247
00:17:43,790 --> 00:17:46,520
And I'm dressed as doodie.
我打扮的跟個傻瓜一樣

248
00:17:47,430 --> 00:17:53,160
-You're Spud-nik. -Come on, who we kidding? I'm doodie.
-你是波特多尼克 -少來了，我們要騙誰呢？我是傻瓜

249
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:56,300
Please? She's watching.
拜託，她在看我

250
00:17:57,170 --> 00:18:00,470
-Fine. -Thanks.
-好吧 -謝謝

251
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:04,010
-Oh, no. -Oh, yeah!
-不 -太棒了

252
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,870
My hero!
我的英雄

253
00:18:07,150 --> 00:18:09,450
You're a weird lady.
你是個怪女人

254
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:15,610
Ursula said she left her purse.
烏蘇拉忘了拿皮包

255
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:19,520
What a relief. It has the numbers for her prayer chain.
這真的是太好了 裡面放了她祈禱團朋友的電話

256
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:21,850
I'm sure it does.
是啊

257
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:25,060
Guess I'll see you at the wedding.
我們婚禮上見了

258
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:30,170
I don't think I'm gonna make it to the wedding.
我想我沒辦法 去參加婚禮

259
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,800
I wish you all the luck in the world.
祝你們好運

260
00:18:32,970 --> 00:18:35,700
And I also want to give you a little piece of advice..
我還要給你 一個小建議

261
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,340
that I give to everyone who's getting married.
我會給每對新人 這樣的建議

262
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:40,210
Don't trust your wife.
別相信你的太太

263
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:43,380
I think we'll be okay.
我想我們會沒事的

264
00:18:43,620 --> 00:18:47,950
It's so perfect, and she's been saving herself for me.
它真的太完美了 她一直為我保持處子之身

265
00:18:49,890 --> 00:18:53,790
-I can't let you do this. She's lying. -What?
-我不能讓你這麼做，她在說謊 -什麼？

266
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:58,160
She is lying. And I bet I could prove it. Excuse me.
她在說謊 我想我可以證明，對不起

267
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:01,630
Okay. Yeah, not a prayer chain.
好吧，沒有祈禱團的電話

268
00:19:01,870 --> 00:19:07,310
But what looks like a detailed drawing of a bank floor plan.
但它看起來像是 銀行的平面圖

269
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:12,480
Here's the name tag from where she works as a waitress.
這是她在餐廳 當女服務生的名牌

270
00:19:12,710 --> 00:19:14,980
Not a teacher, a waitress.
她不是老師，她是女服務生

271
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,810
Here, she always lies about this.
拿去，她總是會撒這個謊

272
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:22,750
-How old did she say she was? -She told me she was 25.
-她跟你說她幾歲了？ -她說她25歲

273
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,620
I almost don't want to show you.
我真的不想拿給你看

274
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:28,850
Just remember, I'm a minute younger.
記住，我比她年輕一分鐘

275
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:33,830
I am so stupid.
我太笨了

276
00:19:34,070 --> 00:19:36,330
Of course she's not a teacher.
她當然不是老師

277
00:19:36,540 --> 00:19:42,000
There's no such thing as a "Top Secret School for the Children of Spies."
根本不會有 「超機密兒童間諜學校」

278
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:46,370
No, you're not stupid.
不，你不笨

279
00:19:47,210 --> 00:19:49,440
I'm not smart.
我不聰明

280
00:19:52,690 --> 00:19:57,350
I just wanted so much to be impulsive for once.
我只是很想 衝動一下

281
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:59,460
-To be romantic. -Good.
-找一點浪漫 -很好

282
00:19:59,690 --> 00:20:05,650
You should be impulsive and romantic. You did it with the wrong person.
你應該要衝動跟浪漫 只是你找錯對象了

283
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:12,030
-What? -It's weird, two people look so alike.
-什麼？ -那真的很奇怪，你們長得那麼像

284
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:13,970
And so different.
卻完全不一樣

285
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:19,280
Eric! Let's go!
艾力克，我們走吧

286
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:24,280
-Better go deal with it. -Yeah, you should.
-我得去解決問題 -沒錯，你該那麼做

287
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:32,820
Hurry up! I gotta pray!
快點，我得去禱告

288
00:20:43,970 --> 00:20:47,700
I had to give the kid 50 bucks to stop crying.
我得給那孩子50塊 他才不哭

289
00:20:47,940 --> 00:20:49,000
That's not bad.
那還不賴

290
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:53,270
I also had to go to a few houses as his girlfriend.
我還得當他的女朋友 陪他走一段路

291
00:20:54,410 --> 00:20:56,580
I am awful with children.
我真的不會應付小孩子

292
00:20:56,920 --> 00:21:01,250
You're good with kids. They're just crazy on Halloween.
你跟孩子們相處的很好 只是小孩子在萬聖節都會抓狂

293
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:04,950
They're all greedy, hopped up on sugar.
他們貪心地 想多拿一些糖果

294
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:07,720
-That's all it is? -Absolutely.
-就那樣？ -當然

295
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:14,590
Halloween is the worst. Except for Christmas. And their birthdays.
萬聖節是最糟糕的 除了耶誕節跟他們的生日

296
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:17,930
They get crazy during the summer too.
他們在暑假也會抓狂

297
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:21,630
And any time they're hungry or sleepy.
還有他們勝子餓 跟想睡覺的時候

298
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:24,970
Kids are tough. Good luck with that.
小孩子很難纏 祝你好運

299
00:21:29,020 --> 00:21:31,680
Look, I'm sorry you lost.
聽著，我很遺憾你輸了

300
00:21:32,190 --> 00:21:35,640
I got a secret for you. I let him win.
我得告訴你一個秘密 我放水讓他贏

301
00:21:36,460 --> 00:21:39,020
Was that a secret, or a lie?
那是秘密還是謊話？

302
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:41,280
-No, I let him.. Ross? -Yeah?
-不，我讓他…羅斯 -什麼事？

303
00:21:41,560 --> 00:21:44,690
Would you tell her I let you win, please?
麻煩你告訴她 我放水讓你贏

304
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:48,560
Chandler "let me win."
錢德「放水讓我贏」

305
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:55,070
No, Chandler's really strong. My arm is so sore. Oh, nurse?
不，錢德真的好壯 我的手好酸喔，護士

306
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:58,400
I am strong. I'll show you.
我很強壯，我要證明給你看

307
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:00,080
Chandler, please.
錢德，拜託

308
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:02,210
What's the matter? Scared?
